class SyncViewModel(private val d:V1PresentationDependencies):ViewModel(){private val _state=MutableStateFlow<FeatureUiState<SyncMetadata>>(FeatureUiState.Loading);val state=_state.asStateFlow();fun load(s:StoreId){viewModelScope.launch{_state.value=when(val r=d.getSyncState(s)){is CoreResult.Success->FeatureUiState.Success(r.value);is CoreResult.Failure->FeatureUiState.Error(r.error.toString())}}};fun sync(s:StoreId){viewModelScope.launch{d.syncPending(s);load(s)}}}
class ConflictsViewModel(private val d:V1PresentationDependencies):ViewModel(){private val _state=MutableStateFlow<FeatureUiState<List<Conflict>>>(FeatureUiState.Loading);val state=_state.asStateFlow();fun load(s:StoreId){viewModelScope.launch{_state.value=when(val r=d.getConflicts(s)){is CoreResult.Success->if(r.value.isEmpty())FeatureUiState.Empty else FeatureUiState.Success(r.value);is CoreResult.Failure->FeatureUiState.Error(r.error.toString())}}};fun resolve(s:StoreId,id:EntityId,r:ConflictResolution){viewModelScope.launch{d.resolveConflict(s,id,r);load(s)}}}

@Composable fun V1WooGitApp(d:V1PresentationDependencies){val nav=rememberNavController();var activeStore by rememberSaveable{mutableStateOf(d.initialStoreId)};NavHost(navController=nav,startDestination=if(activeStore==null)"connection" else "dashboard"){composable("connection"){ConnectionScreen(d){id->activeStore=id;nav.navigate("dashboard"){popUpTo("connection"){inclusive=true}}}};composable("dashboard"){activeStore?.let{Dashboard(nav,StoreId(it))}};composable("orders"){activeStore?.let{OrdersScreen(d,StoreId(it),nav)}};composable("orders/{id}",arguments=listOf(navArgument("id"){type=NavType.StringType})){b->activeStore?.let{OrderDetailScreen(d,StoreId(it),EntityId(b.arguments?.getString("id")?:"0"))}};composable("products"){activeStore?.let{ProductsScreen(d,StoreId(it),nav)}};composable("products/{id}",arguments=listOf(navArgument("id"){type=NavType.StringType})){b->activeStore?.let{ProductDetailScreen(d,StoreId(it),EntityId(b.arguments?.getString("id")?:"0"),nav)}};composable("variations/{productId}",arguments=listOf(navArgument("productId"){type=NavType.StringType})){b->activeStore?.let{VariationsScreen(d,StoreId(it),EntityId(b.arguments?.getString("productId")?:"0"))}};composable("attributes"){activeStore?.let{AttributesScreen(d,StoreId(it),nav)}};composable("terms/{attributeId}",arguments=listOf(navArgument("attributeId"){type=NavType.StringType})){b->activeStore?.let{TermsScreen(d,StoreId(it),EntityId(b.arguments?.getString("attributeId")?:"0"))}};composable("sync"){activeStore?.let{SyncScreen(d,StoreId(it))}};composable("conflicts"){activeStore?.let{ConflictsScreen(d,StoreId(it))}};composable("settings"){activeStore?.let{SettingsScreen(d,StoreId(it),nav)}}}}

@Composable private fun ConnectionScreen(d:V1PresentationDependencies,onConnected:(String)->Unit){val vm:ConnectionViewModel=viewModel(factory=vmFactory{ConnectionViewModel(d)});val state by vm.state.collectAsState();var url by rememberSaveable{mutableStateOf("")};var key by rememberSaveable{mutableStateOf("")};var secret by rememberSaveable{mutableStateOf("")};Column(Modifier.fillMaxSize().padding(24.dp),verticalArrangement=Arrangement.spacedBy(12.dp)){Text("اتصال فروشگاه",style=MaterialTheme.typography.headlineMedium);OutlinedTextField(url,{url=it},label={Text("Store URL")},modifier=Modifier.fillMaxWidth());OutlinedTextField(key,{key=it},label={Text("Consumer Key")},modifier=Modifier.fillMaxWidth());OutlinedTextField(secret,{secret=it},label={Text("Consumer Secret")},visualTransformation=PasswordVisualTransformation(),modifier=Modifier.fillMaxWidth());if(state is FeatureUiState.Error)Text((state as FeatureUiState.Error).message);Button(enabled=url.isNotBlank()&&key.isNotBlank()&&secret.isNotBlank(),onClick={vm.connect(url,key,secret)},modifier=Modifier.fillMaxWidth()){Text("اتصال")}}}
